2. Codex (codex-cli-main/codex-rs upstream sources) — Apache-2.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

xClaw vendors portions of OpenAI's `codex` workspace (https://github.com/openai/codex)
under codex-cli-main/ for byte-for-byte verbatim porting into dasclaw_*
crates per ADR-129 §1.3. Codex's NOTICE and LICENSE files are preserved
verbatim at codex-cli-main/NOTICE and codex-cli-main/LICENSE respectively.
The Ratatui MIT attribution carried by codex's NOTICE applies transitively
to any ratatui-derived code ported into xClaw.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

